  "title": "Mexican Chicken and Black Bean Salad",
  "description": "Chicken breast is baked in a tomato-based sauce and served atop a bed of spinach leaves in this simple salad. Black beans, cheese, sour cream, and salsa toppings provide a Mexican flair.",
